We are using {\field {\*\fldinst { HYPERLINK "https://github.com/inorton/junit2html" }{}}{\fldrslt {\cs37\ul\cf2 GitHub - inorton/junit2html: Turn Junit XML reports into self contained HTML reports}}} to convert junit xml formatted test results to HTML page for reporting also we store logs during test. Use following commands to install this module with pip\par
